                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I think I got this one sale for 3 dollars. It was definitely worth it.  The game is only a couple hours long but it was smooth and enjoyable.  You travel the areas saving the towns folk each person gives you a different ability which you get to keep until the next area you save.  Its a nice concept because the different areas can be built around the different abilities you have collected.  I would be disappointed by the length of the game but for three dollars I really cant be plus that just means I wanted to keep playing it longer!  \n Try it out - its a fun relaxing little platformer - Its very forgiving, not a lot of challenge but sometimes that is perfect",
